      "message": "I can\u0027t say for sure the purpose that this function was designed for. But as I can see from the sources the only place that it is used is moving of storage in the `pm`.\n\nAlso, not sure that I understood a comment in `frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/storage/StorageManager.java` correctly but it seems that the `StorageManager.setPrimaryStorageUuid` is supposed to be called only via `PackageManager.movePrimaryStorage`:\n\n```\n    /**                                                                                                                                                                                                     \n     * This is not the API you\u0027re looking for.                                                                                                                                                              \n     *                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n     * @see PackageManager#movePrimaryStorage(VolumeInfo)                                                                                                                                                   \n     * @hide                                                                                                                                                                                                \n     */                                                                                                                                                                                                     \n    public void setPrimaryStorageUuid(String volumeUuid, IPackageMoveObserver callback) {\n    ...\n```\n\nIt would be nice if storage manager owners comment.",
