        "id": 1013984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-17T20:10:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I think we might need to a proper fix to either keep the lock longer or add a new lock (probably the former, as there\u0027s too many locks already), but that issue is already there, regardless of this change - I filed b/183030528 for that",
      "parentUuid": "cacc5510_1f26bb3a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5065,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 5065,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "601b49c4f2207847e06ef3dd0dbb2132bbbf656f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fe2d0343_740cb5ea",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/pm/UserManagerService.java",
